{"id":388,"gn":"Pokémon Bosquet","ft":["Il sait d’instinct où trouver une source d’eau pure. Il y transporte d’autres Pokémon sur son dos.","Il vit en forêt près de l’eau. En journée, il la quitte pour dorer sa carapace feuillue au soleil."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":1,"24":0,"25":1,"26":0},"tt":["Il vit le long de l'eau dans les forêts. Dans la journée, il quitte la forêt pour bronzer sa coquille arborescente.","La coquille est un sol durci. Certains Pokémon viennent piquer les baies qui poussent sur les arbres sur son dos.","Elle sait où se trouve l'eau pure. Il porte Pokémon sur son dos.","Une Boskara qui vit dans la forêt aurait sa propre eau de source secrète.","Apparaît là où il y a de l'eau de source propre. Le fruit qui pousse sur les arbustes sur sa coquille est doux, nutritif et vraiment délicieux."],"tv":{"12":0,"13":1,"14":2,"15":3,"16":3,"21":2,"22":2,"39":4},"gr":1,"cr":45,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Monstrueux","Végétal"],"gw":"medium-slow","gm":{"svdisk":[0,192],"la":[0,131],"bdsp":[0,2],"pt":[0,2],"dp":[0,2]},"f":{"388":{"n":"Boskara","t":["grass"],"s":[75,89,85,55,65,36],"h":1.1,"w":97,"a":[[65,0],[75,1]],"pa":[[4,[[65,0]]]],"av":["svdisk","la","bdsp","pt","dp"],"ls":[{"l":[[33,1],[71,1],[110,1],[75,13],[174,17],[44,22],[72,27],[73,32],[235,37],[242,42],[202,47],[437,52]],"m":[14,34,36,38,46,76,113,115,133,156,164,174,182,189,202,203,214,241,242,263,328,331,341,345,402,412,414,428,437,442,446,447,479,484,520,523,580,803,851,885],"e":[37,38,74,254,255,256,276,321,388,469,504]},{"l":[[33,1],[670,6],[44,11],[523,18],[79,25],[348,34],[38,43]]},{"l":[[71,1],[33,1],[110,1],[110,5],[670,6],[74,10],[75,13],[174,17],[44,22],[72,27],[73,32],[235,37],[242,42],[202,47],[437,52]],"m":[14,15,70,76,104,113,115,148,156,164,182,202,203,207,213,214,219,231,241,249,263,331,412,431,446,447,526]},{"l":[[33,1],[110,1],[110,5],[71,9],[75,13],[174,17],[44,22],[72,27],[73,32],[235,37],[242,42],[202,47],[437,52]],"m":[14,15,70,76,92,104,113,115,148,156,164,182,202,203,207,213,214